{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outsmart the swarm. Every tile, every tower, every move counts.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hearthguard is a tactical tower defense game that rewards clever pathing, smart placement, and flexible strategy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build mazes, manage your resources, and defend against endless waves of enemies on a battlefield made of tiles. The map tiles can be different every time you play, so you\u2019ll need to adapt your tactics each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You place units and towers to build your defense, each with a unique role:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ranged towers</strong> \u2013 Static units</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traps</strong> \u2013 Damage or slow enemies passing through</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Walls</strong> \u2013 Used to shape enemy paths (mazing)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Support towers</strong> \u2013 Generate extra gold over time and boost the stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Units</strong> \u2013 Melee and ranged units that defend your castle and attack the enemy nexus.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your towers can become stronger or weaker depending on where you place them. Tiles and nearby towers give different bonuses and penalties, so careful positioning is key. You can also upgrade some towers during battle to increase their power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of each run, you choose a hero. Each hero gives different bonuses that can change how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're planning the perfect maze, creating strong tower combinations, or reacting to surprise enemy attacks, <strong>Hearthguard</strong> is all about using your brain to stay one step ahead.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3713520?t=1768984579","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3713520?t=1768984579","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713520/2c00e3f7a6789d634de149545a286cc2ae3bbe0a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768984579","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713520/2c00e3f7a6789d634de149545a286cc2ae3bbe0a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768984579","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outsmart the swarm. Every tile, every tower, every move counts.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hearthguard is a tactical tower defense game that rewards clever pathing, smart placement, and flexible strategy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build mazes, manage your resources, and defend against endless waves of enemies on a battlefield made of tiles. The map tiles can be different every time you play, so you\u2019ll need to adapt your tactics each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You place units and towers to build your defense, each with a unique role:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ranged towers</strong> \u2013 Static units</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traps</strong> \u2013 Damage or slow enemies passing through</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Walls</strong> \u2013 Used to shape enemy paths (mazing)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Support towers</strong> \u2013 Generate extra gold over time and boost the stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Units</strong> \u2013 Melee and ranged units that defend your castle and attack the enemy nexus.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your towers can become stronger or weaker depending on where you place them. Tiles and nearby towers give different bonuses and penalties, so careful positioning is key. You can also upgrade some towers during battle to increase their power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of each run, you choose a hero. Each hero gives different bonuses that can change how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're planning the perfect maze, creating strong tower combinations, or reacting to surprise enemy attacks, <strong>Hearthguard</strong> is all about using your brain to stay one step ahead.</p>","developers":[" Sleepy Creepy Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713520/a57d4920ce3500c7ec507e2f8afecc7ae3788b3b/header.jpg?t=1768984579","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3713520/561939428/2f2bc411b88664acbfee4aa8e13fbe67d956072f/1767542081/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767543951","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3713520/561939428/2f2bc411b88664acbfee4aa8e13fbe67d956072f/1767542081/dash_h264.mpd?t=1767543951","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3713520/561939428/2f2bc411b88664acbfee4aa8e13fbe67d956072f/1767542081/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1767543951","id":257259196,"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257259196/af60064d5aa7801d5a02ab8e0833c038ea2466ee/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1767543951"}],"name":"Hearthguard","package_groups":[],